<!-- B «Северное сияние», one style with the AI helper (DESIGN.md). The light screen: its «dawn haze», the same sky at
     first light. The colour roles are the same in values-night (the night sky): «on» is the one colour of «включено /
     защищено» everywhere (the button, the connection in use); «accent» fills buttons and switches (darker by day, for
     contrast); line_strong is the edge of a control (3:1 on the background), line only divides. -->
